<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2019%20-%20Mean%20Entropic%20Drawdown%20at%20Risk%20(EDaR)%20Optimization.ipynb::chunk:16> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 16 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_section" ;
    rf:content """## 3. Estimating Risk Parity Portfolios for EDaR

### 3.1 Calculating the risk parity portfolio for EDaR.

The risk parity portfolio for the EDaR risk measure is the solution of the problem:

$$
\\begin{aligned}
& \\min_{w,\\, z} & & \\text{EDaR}_{\\alpha}(r w) - b \\ln(w)\\\\
& & & 1^{T}w = 0 \\\\
& & & w \\geq 0 \\\\
\\end{aligned}
$$

Where $w$ are the weights of assets, $b$ is the vector of constraints, by default is a vector of 1/(number of assets).""" ;
    rf:content_hash "5317125ea01a1785bac46a1b39d3b516ee587471646bf268cf0732bc925922cb" ;
    rf:line_end 14 ;
    rf:line_start 14 ;
