<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2020%20-%20Mean%20Risk%20Optimization%20using%20Black%20Litterman%20and%20Risk%20Factors%20Models.ipynb::chunk:40> a rf:Chunk ;
