### 2.1 Calculating the portfolio that maximizes Risk Adjusted Return.""" ;
    rf:content_hash "89672613021c4d62e8ba1ca452eefe0f219deaa19be6123d9e7e802dbff0dc7c" ;
    rf:line_end 11 ;
