<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2025%20-%20Hierarchical%20Equal%20Risk%20Contribution%20(HERC)%20Portfolio%20Optimization.ipynb::chunk:5> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 5 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_section" ;
    rf:content """The graph above suggest that optimal number of clusters are four.

## 2. Estimating HERC Portfolio

This is the original model proposed by Raffinot (2018). Riskfolio-Lib expand this model to 32 risk measures.

### 2.1 Calculating the HERC portfolio""" ;
    rf:content_hash "e59c9243aace81b4e98dcf5e12b984df58202c092a4c225b2de9dcb1fb8b8d43" ;
    rf:line_end 5 ;
    rf:line_start 5 ;
    rf:relative_path "Tutorial 25 - Hierarchical Equal Risk Contribution (HERC) Portfolio Optimization.ipynb" ;
    rf:section "example_section" ;
    rf:source_path "/Users/et/Desktop/Data_Projects/Riskfolio-Lib/examples/Tutorial 25 - Hierarchical Equal Risk Contribution (HERC) Portfolio Optimization.ipynb" .

<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2025%20-%20Hierarchical%20Equal%20Risk%20Contribution%20(HERC)%20Portfolio%20Optimization.ipynb::chunk:6> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 6 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_cell" ;
    rf:content """# Building the portfolio object
port = rp.HCPortfolio(returns=Y)

# Estimate optimal portfolio:

model='HERC' # Could be HRP or HERC
codependence = 'pearson' # Correlation matrix used to group assets in clusters
rm = 'MV' # Risk measure used, this time will be variance
rf = 0 # Risk free rate
linkage = 'ward' # Linkage method used to build clusters
max_k = 10 # Max number of clusters used in two difference gap statistic
leaf_order = True # Consider optimal order of leafs in dendrogram

w = port.optimization(model=model,
                      codependence=codependence,
                      rm=rm,
                      rf=rf,
                      linkage=linkage,
                      max_k=max_k,
                      leaf_order=leaf_order)

display(w.T)""" ;
    rf:content_hash "40208dde1ccb98bf6cc1dccc4ed96c7e29bd0033b3bdaa328fcfeded07fb19bd" ;
    rf:line_end 6 ;
    rf:line_start 6 ;
    rf:relative_path "Tutorial 25 - Hierarchical Equal Risk Contribution (HERC) Portfolio Optimization.ipynb" ;
    rf:section "example_cell" ;
    rf:source_path "/Users/et/Desktop/Data_Projects/Riskfolio-Lib/examples/Tutorial 25 - Hierarchical Equal Risk Contribution (HERC) Portfolio Optimization.ipynb" .

