    rf:chunk_index 6 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_section" ;
    rf:content """In the charts above we can see that DBHT and ward linkage build better hierarchical structures. Also, both methods seem to classify better the assets in clusters.

## 3. Comparing Linkage Methods using Dendrograms and Standarized Silhouette Index for Optimal Number of Clusters""" ;
