<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2035%20-%20Gini%20Mean%20Difference%20(GMD)%20Optimization.ipynb::chunk:5> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 5 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_section" ;
    rf:content """, due to it requires more computing power for the number of constraints and variables the model use.

Instructions to install MOSEK are in this __[link](https://docs.mosek.com/9.2/install/installation.html)__, is better to install using Anaconda. Also you will need a license, I recommend you that ask for an academic license __[here](https://www.mosek.com/products/academic-licenses/)__.

### 2.1 Calculating the portfolio that optimize return/GMD ratio.""" ;
    rf:content_hash "cff0b524e7eb35d1fbbd0477998f9fedfa714bcde1f7f822efcba239db2d1de9" ;
    rf:line_end 4 ;
