<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2044%20-%20Hierarchical%20Equal%20Risk%20Contribution%20(HERC)%20Portfolio%20Optimization%20with%20Constraints.ipynb::chunk:5> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 5 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_section" ;
    rf:content """The dendrogram above suggest that optimal number of clusters are four.

## 2. Estimating HERC Portfolio

This is the original model proposed by Raffinot (2018). Riskfolio-Lib expand this model to 32 risk measures.

### 2.1 Calculating the HERC portfolio""" ;
    rf:content_hash "e4404e5e99701b4afe0892d5323d7fbac72fdab6ffa9da5207151e6485019fec" ;
    rf:line_end 5 ;
    rf:line_start 5 ;
    rf:relative_path "Tutorial 44 - Hierarchical Equal Risk Contribution (HERC) Portfolio Optimization with Constraints.ipynb" ;
    rf:section "example_section" ;
    rf:source_path "/Users/et/Desktop/Data_Projects/Riskfolio-Lib/examples/Tutorial 44 - Hierarchical Equal Risk Contribution (HERC) Portfolio Optimization with Constraints.ipynb" .

<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2044%20-%20Hierarchical%20Equal%20Risk%20Contribution%20(HERC)%20Portfolio%20Optimization%20with%20Constraints.ipynb::chunk:6> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 6 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_cell" ;
    rf:content """# Building the portfolio object
port = rp.HCPortfolio(returns=Y)

# Estimate optimal portfolio:

model = 'HERC' # Could be HRP, HERC or NCO
codependence = 'pearson' # Correlation matrix used to group assets in clusters
rm = 'MV' # Risk measure used, this time will be variance
rf = 0 # Risk free rate
linkage = 'ward' # Linkage method used to build clusters
max_k = 10 # Max number of clusters used in two difference gap statistic
leaf_order = True # Consider optimal order of leafs in dendrogram

w = port.optimization(model=model,
                      codependence=codependence,
                      rm=rm,
                      rf=rf,
                      linkage=linkage,
                      max_k=max_k,
                      leaf_order=leaf_order)

display(w.T)""" ;
    rf:content_hash "45b7fce23ee3c40a7cd32df668dded62e319e16f37f9133206cdfdd663571a75" ;
    rf:line_end 6 ;
    rf:line_start 6 ;
