<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2045%20-%20Nested%20Clustered%20Optimization%20(NCO)%20Portfolio%20Optimization%20with%20Constraints.ipynb::chunk:5> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 5 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_section" ;
    rf:content """The graph above suggest that optimal number of clusters are four.

## 2. Estimating NCO Portfolio

This is the original model proposed by López de Prado (2019). Riskfolio-Lib expand this model to 13 risk measures and for objective functions: "Minimize Risk", "Maximize Utility Function", "Maximize Return/Risk Ratio" and "Equal Risk Contribution".

### 2.1 Calculating the NCO portfolio""" ;
    rf:content_hash "2fa9d820db1154caf13c6a5252fb2310cafd0efbdb33afd6da94224dba824815" ;
    rf:line_end 5 ;
    rf:line_start 5 ;
    rf:relative_path "Tutorial 45 - Nested Clustered Optimization (NCO) Portfolio Optimization with Constraints.ipynb" ;
    rf:section "example_section" ;
    rf:source_path "/Users/et/Desktop/Data_Projects/Riskfolio-Lib/examples/Tutorial 45 - Nested Clustered Optimization (NCO) Portfolio Optimization with Constraints.ipynb" .

<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2045%20-%20Nested%20Clustered%20Optimization%20(NCO)%20Portfolio%20Optimization%20with%20Constraints.ipynb::chunk:6> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 6 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_cell" ;
    rf:content """# Building the portfolio object
port = rp.HCPortfolio(returns=Y)

# Estimate optimal portfolio:

model='NCO' # Could be HRP, HERC or NCO
codependence = 'pearson' # Correlation matrix used to group assets in clusters
method_cov = 'hist' # Covariance estimation technique
obj = "MinRisk" # Posible values are "MinRisk", "Utility", "Sharpe" and "ERC"
rm = 'MV' # Risk measure used, this time will be variance
rf = 0 # Risk free rate
l = 2 # Risk aversion factor, only usefull with "Utility" objective
linkage = 'ward' # Linkage method used to build clusters
max_k = 10 # Max number of clusters used in two difference gap statistic
leaf_order = True # Consider optimal order of leafs in dendrogram

w = port.optimization(model=model,
                      codependence=codependence,
                      method_cov=method_cov,
                      obj=obj,
                      rm=rm,
                      rf=rf,
                      l=l,
                      linkage=linkage,""" ;
    rf:content_hash "0e95bc9f135525df087397e7d2058c4936cfcb95c690ad9f9c67783a854d24d7" ;
    rf:line_end 6 ;
    rf:line_start 6 ;
    rf:relative_path "Tutorial 45 - Nested Clustered Optimization (NCO) Portfolio Optimization with Constraints.ipynb" ;
    rf:section "example_cell" ;
    rf:source_path "/Users/et/Desktop/Data_Projects/Riskfolio-Lib/examples/Tutorial 45 - Nested Clustered Optimization (NCO) Portfolio Optimization with Constraints.ipynb" .

<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%2045%20-%20Nested%20Clustered%20Optimization%20(NCO)%20Portfolio%20Optimization%20with%20Constraints.ipynb::chunk:7> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 7 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_cell" ;
    rf:content """rf=rf,
                      l=l,
                      linkage=linkage,
                      max_k=max_k,
                      leaf_order=leaf_order)

display(w.T)""" ;
    rf:content_hash "40d8b15f0421a590a38383467eab1f3e73cbe7f4959965b1ea2212f47fb96bf1" ;
    rf:line_end 6 ;
