    rf:content """## 2. Estimating Risk Parity Portfolios with Stepwise Regression

### 2.1 Estimating the loadings matrix with Stepwise Regression

This part is just to visualize how Riskfolio-Lib calculates a loadings matrix using PCR.""" ;
    rf:content_hash "d4960e6b16cff858f3ea78e39ede4cb8c64385bc881eb3401e279a455f3aaa39" ;
    rf:line_end 4 ;
    rf:line_start 4 ;
