### 3.1 Calculating the portfolio that maximizes Sharpe ratio.""" ;
    rf:content_hash "7bca6d6c1a7f26975681f82a172c7f6de1859cccf2c24ba27ee6a9a3f1341b26" ;
    rf:line_end 12 ;
