<https://riskfolio-graphrag.io/kg/v2/Tutorial%209%20-%20Portfolio%20Optimization%20using%20Risk%20Factors%20and%20Principal%20Components%20Regression%20(PCR).ipynb::chunk:15> a rf:Chunk ;
    rf:chunk_index 15 ;
    rf:chunk_kind "example_section" ;
    rf:content """## 3. Estimating Portfolios Using Risk Factors with Other Risk Measures and PCR

In this part I will calculate optimal portfolios for several risk measures using a __mean estimate based on PCR__. I will find the portfolios that maximize the risk adjusted return for all available risk measures.

### 3.1 Calculate Optimal Portfolios for Several Risk Measures.

I will mantain the constraints on risk factors.""" ;
    rf:content_hash "5168832624c0b3b8bbc00a846f82c1300bd1834a9016695785e304d8daadc9ee" ;
    rf:line_end 14 ;
    rf:line_start 14 ;
