    * Relativistic Value at Risk Range.
    * Range.

    **Downside Risk Measures:**

    * Semi Standard Deviation.
    * Square Root Semi Kurtosis.
    * First Lower Partial Moment (Omega Ratio).
    * Second Lower Partial Moment (Sortino Ratio).""" ;
